OL,3,GNEWSANepalese restaurant fundraises for
OL,4,Afloods victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Nepalese restaurant owner from is
OL,7,Fraising money to help people back
OL,8,Faffected by devastating floods in the
OL,9,Fcountry.
OL,11,FMore than 1,000 people are known to
OL,12,Fhave died, and more than 5,000 are
OL,13,Fstill missing, after a flash flood
OL,14,Fbelieved to have been triggered by a
OL,15,Fglacial collapse, swept through border
OL,16,Fvillages two weeks ago.
OL,18,FRobin Sharma owns two venues in
OL,19,FShrewsbury, the Avatar in Mardol, and
OL,20,FYak & Yeti in Frankwell, and decided to
OL,21,Fhost charity dinner nights every Monday
OL,22,Fin September.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
