OL,3,GNEWSANepalese restaurant fundraises for
OL,4,Afloods victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FSharma said he "hopes to collect a good
OL,7,Famount of money" as he thought it was
OL,8,Fthe right thing to do. He added a
OL,9,Fmember of his staff had family who had
OL,10,Flost their property in the affected
OL,11,Farea of Nepal.
